Planning permission for application reference 2025/2047/01/DET
be granted:
 

 
i. 
Subject to a section 106 agreement to secure
£64,924.40.

 

 
ii. 
Subject to the following conditions:

 

1. 
3 year consent;

2. 
List of approved drawings;

3. 
Investigation and Risk Assessment;

4. 
Remediation Scheme;

5. 
Construction Method Statement;

6. 
Erect tree protection fencing;

7. 
Habitat Management and Monitoring Plan;

8. 
Cotoneaster Horizontalis
Management Plan;

9. 
Details of phasing, layout and design of gates
serving industrial estate;

10.Details of hard and soft landscaping;

11.Details of finishing materials;

12.Details of substation;

13.Details of cycle parking;

14.Details of surface water drainage scheme;

15.Protection to sewers and pipes;

16.Future surface water connectivity;

17.Landscaping trench;

18.Green
roof details;

19.Root
protection;

20.Drainage validation;

21.Submit noise impact assessment and acoustic treatment for
